cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use SYMFLUENCE in your research, please cite it using the metadata below, alongside the
  companion papers (Eythorsson et al., 2026a,b,c; Water Resources Research). Authorship of this software
  record follows the FORCE11 software citation principles and is distinct from authorship of the papers;
  additional contributors are credited with typed roles in the Zenodo record.
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21257967
title: 'SYMFLUENCE: SYnergistic Modelling Framework for Linking and Unifying Earth-system Nexii for Computational
  Exploration'
type: software
